Vanilla recipe and item-tag snapshot
====================================

`src/vanillaCatalog.ts` and `src/vanillaItemTags.ts` contain Minecraft Bedrock
recipe and item-tag data derived from Mojang's public bedrock-samples /
vanilla-tags dumps (see `VANILLA_CATALOG_MINECRAFT` in vanillaCatalog.ts).

That data is © Mojang Studios. It is included for interoperability with the
public game. It is **not** licensed under the MIT License that covers the rest
of this project. This project does not claim authorship of it.
